dict(id='KWG-07',severity='minor',kind='one-ended naming',items=['KERNEL-0177','KERNEL-0181','KERNEL-0172','KERNEL-0182'],claim="Kernel services whose callers exist only by description: offsetFace (S11 per-edge setbacks per §3.7's M0 text; §4.7 S11 does not name it), hexLattice (§4.3 describes the routing lattice without the name), sampleProfile (kerb/bandUnion internally; §8's width rendering does not name it), hull and sampleBoundary (internal to obb and the sampled medial axis), area2Big (boolean operands), orient (orient2d exposed). Each is wired internally or by content; the consumer side does not name the op.",link='Consumers name the op at their home (§4.3 hexLattice, §4.7 S11 offsetFace); internal-only services are marked internal in §3.4.'),
